          ],
          "content": "| Without | With compounding, |\n| --- | --- |\n| compounding, | p × (1 + r) × (1 + r) × … × (1 + r) = p (1 + r)<sup>t</sup> |\n| p (1 + rt) | Principal for term 1 |\n| p remains the | Principal for term 2 |\n| principal for all | Principal for term 3 |\n| the terms. | Principal for term t |",
          "captions": [],
